msgstr "%s 设为 \"%s\" — qosify 用 atoi() 转换它，因此仅非零数字表示开启"

#: applications/luci-app-qosify/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/qosify/main.js:750
msgid "%s quick settings"
msgstr "%s 快速设置"

