#: applications/luci-app-qosify/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/qosify/main.js:1022
msgid ""
"Defaults qosify applies when a key is absent — interface: mode diffserv4, "
"ingress 1, egress 1, nat 1, host_isolate 1, autorate_ingress 0. device: "
"identical except nat 0. defaults: timeout 3600, dscp_default_tcp/udp CS0, "
"dscp_prio/dscp_bulk/dscp_icmp unset, bulk_trigger_pps/bulk_trigger_timeout/"
"prio_max_avg_pkt_len 0 (disabled)."
msgstr ""
"没有密钥时 qosify 应用的默认设置 — 接口：mode diffserv4, ingress 1, egress "
"1, nat 1, host_isolate 1, autorate_ingress 0。设备：相同，除了 nat 0。默认： "
"timeout 3600, dscp_default_tcp/udp CS0, dscp_prio/dscp_bulk/dscp_icmp unset, "
"bulk_trigger_pps/bulk_trigger_timeout/prio_max_avg_pkt_len 0（禁用）。"

