#: applications/luci-app-qosify/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/qosify/main.js:1166
msgid ""
"Each line has two whitespace separated fields, match and dscp. dscp can be a "
"raw value, a codepoint like CS0, or a class name. DNS entries are compared "
